The ten TF2 player class scripts, for TfClassDataTests / TfClassTableTests.

Source: scripts/playerclasses/<raw class name>.ctx in the shipped
tf/tf2_misc_dir.vpk (Steam install, sha256 b1e36819d6ae5f5f...), extracted
2026-10-25 with

    tools/vpk-extract bin/debug/content/tf/tf2_misc_dir.vpk \
        scripts/playerclasses/{scout,sniper,soldier,demoman,medic,heavyweapons,pyro,spy,engineer,civilian}.ctx \
        -o OUT --ice-key E2NcUkG2

(ICE level 0 under GetTFEncryptionKey(), TfEncryption.Key), then trimmed:
CRLF to LF, comment lines and trailing comments removed (the shipped files
keep older values commented out, e.g. scout's `// "speed_max" "450"`).
Every key the files set is kept; no value was edited.
